{"RukuNumber":454,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":50,"SurahIndex":"050","VerseNumber":30,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"يَوۡمَ نَقُولُ لِجَهَنَّمَ هَلِ ٱمۡتَلَأۡتِ وَتَقُولُ هَلۡ مِن مَّزِيدٖ","TajweedText":"يَوْمَ نَقُولُ لِجَهَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َمَ هَلِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>مْتَلَأْتِ وَتَقُولُ هَلْ م<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ِن م</tajweed>َّز<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed><tajweed class=qalaqah>د</tajweed>ٍ <span class=end>٣٠</span>","End":"٣٠","PageNumber":519,"JuzNumber":26,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":454,"MaqraNumber":208,"HizbNumber":52,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":50,"SurahIndex":"050","VerseNumber":31,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَأُزۡلِفَتِ ٱلۡجَنَّةُ لِلۡمُتَّقِينَ غَيۡرَ بَعِيدٍ","TajweedText":"وَأُزْلِفَتِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْجَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َةُ لِلْمُتَّقِينَ غَيْرَ بَع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed><tajweed class=qalaqah>د</tajweed>ٍ <span class=end>٣١</span>","End":"٣١","PageNumber":519,"JuzNumber":26,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":454,"MaqraNumber":208,"HizbNumber":52,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":50,"SurahIndex":"050","VerseNumber":32,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"هَٰذَا مَا تُوعَدُونَ لِكُلِّ أَوَّابٍ حَفِيظٖ","TajweedText":"هَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ذَا مَا تُوعَدُونَ لِكُلِّ أَوَّابٍ حَف<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>ظٍ <span class=end>٣٢</span>","End":"٣٢","PageNumber":519,"JuzNumber":26,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":454,"MaqraNumber":208,"HizbNumber":52,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":50,"SurahIndex":"050","VerseNumber":33,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"مَّنۡ خَشِيَ ٱلرَّحۡمَٰنَ بِٱلۡغَيۡبِ وَجَآءَ بِقَلۡبٖ مُّنِيبٍ","TajweedText":"مَّنْ خَشِىَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>رَّحْمَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نَ ب